  "description": "Ravi has been on the run ever since she escaped an encounter with a powerful demon hunter. Along the way, she landed herself inside the world of a book…that happens to be a BL novel. Not a single man in this world is straight, and as a succubus, Ravi is quite doomed. But when she finally finds a hot dude interested in her—huh? Wait, is that the demon hunter she’s been running from?! What’s he doing here?!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
